      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start and definitely accurate. \n\nthough, i just ran it through the preliminary check and the \"term density\" score was actually kind of low. my supervisor is pretty picky about it looking \"highly technical\" to justify the research depth. \n\ncan you expand on this to make it a more thorough, deep-dive summary? try to incorporate more of the specific biochemical and physiological mechanisms involved in the LNP process to increase that density score, but again—please make sure it stays a coherent, scientifically rigorous explanation. i don't want it to look like a list of words, it still has to be a professional brief.",
